  "_readme": "GAME CONTENT, DRAFT PENDING PRODUCER REVIEW (every name). The display names of the region map's locations: for each region (regions.json's RegionId, every region exactly once) and each LocationKind (Wilds, Den, Camp, TradingPost, Pass, Lair), exactly NodeMapGenerator.LabelVariants (8) names. A map node's LabelKey \"{regionId}/{kind}/{variant}\" (kind: wilds, den, camp, trading_post, pass, lair; variant 0-7, drawn from the map seed by NodeMapGenerator.Place) resolves to the variant-th name of that region's kind (LocationNameTable.Resolve); a key the table does not cover falls back to the kind's generic name (Wilds, Den, Camp, Trading Post, Pass, Lair). Names are 1-3 words, at most 24 characters, no apostrophes, unique within a region, themed to the region's element flavour (docs/design/content-bible.md). Presentation only: names never affect the maps, their rules or saves (a save keeps the LabelKey, so renaming a location renames it everywhere). Validated by LocationNameTableValidator (the Editor importer Beast Craft/Data/Import Regions, which imports this file with regions.json, and the EditMode tests).",
